Ignoring these concerns does not necessarily make them disappear. Recognizing when something feels difficult and being willing to seek support can create opportunities for healthier coping, stronger relationships, and greater self-understanding.

For men living or working near Houston's Galleria, professional counseling is one option worth exploring.

